flowchart TD
    A[Official PDFs, fictional samples, or authorized local uploads] --> B[Extract text and section or page metadata]
    B --> C[Preserve title, section, year/date, source URL, page, extraction method]
    C --> D[Official: local sparse SQLite index]
    C --> E[Demo: local fictional policy sections]
    Q[Question plus conversation context] --> R[Route intent and resolve follow-up]
    R --> S[Select policy category and source collection]
    D --> T[Retrieve relevant chunks]
    E --> T
    S --> T
    T --> U{Relevant evidence returned?}
    U -- No --> V[Unsupported response, no fabricated citation]
    U -- Yes --> W{Known conflict or requested detail absent?}
    W -- Conflict --> X[Report conflict and do not select a rule]
    W -- Detail absent --> V
    W -- No --> Y[Pass question and retrieved text to selected prompt and Gemini]
    Y --> Z{Generation available?}
    Z -- No --> AA[Explicit service-unavailable error]
    Z -- Yes --> AB[Parse structured response]
    AB --> AC[Match document and section to retrieved chunks]
    AC --> AD[Check quote as exact substring]
    AD --> AE[Check answer and sensitive claims against verified quote]
    AE --> AF{Checks pass?}
    AF -- No --> V
    AF -- Yes --> AG[Answer with verified quote, source link, page, and confidence]
